{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_236_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_236","textTraditional":"一、九年。春王二月，葬〈木巳〉僖公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_236_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_236","textTraditional":"二、宋皇瑗帥師取鄭師于雍丘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_236_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_236","textTraditional":"其言取之何？易也。其易奈何？詐之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_236_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_236","textTraditional":"三、夏，楚人伐陳。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_236_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_236","textTraditional":"四、秋，宋公伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_236_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_236","textTraditional":"五、冬十月。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}